# From "Inner Earth" (Wave VIII - Union, CD4-7). Meant to be entered from
# F12, per the tape ("from Focus 12 you will automatically move to whatever
# focus level is most appropriate"); the perspective shifts through F15, F21,
# and F27 are the tape's own structure, kept as it has them. Teaches its own
# instant-access trigger, "Earth Core 27" -- distinct from every other
# trigger taught elsewhere in the library.

@segment  inner-earth
@title    Inner Earth
@levels   F27
@duration ~7m

say You're going to meet the intelligence that maintains the physical Earth. Say in your mind: I access whatever state of awareness is best for understanding what I'm perceiving, quickly and without effort. I perceive exactly what's most useful for me right now.
pause 8
say Begin at the Earth's surface. Open your perception to the mineral kingdom -- stones, strata, gems. Explore its properties, its energies.
pause 8
say Now the plant kingdom. Flowers, trees, growing things. Explore its properties, its energies.
pause 8
say Now the animal kingdom. Insects, birds, fish, mammals. Explore its wildlife, its properties, its energies.
pause 8
say Now the four elements. Earth first -- explore it.
pause 6
say Water. Explore it.
pause 6
say Fire. Sense it, and explore.
pause 6
say Air. Sense it, and explore.
pause 6
say Now leave the surface behind, and dive in. Move through the layers, deeper, toward the very inner core of the Earth.
pause 10
say As you approach the core, notice a massive crystal -- six-sided, pointed at the poles, glistening like a giant diamond. Take in its facets.
pause 8
say Deep in this crystalline core, ask to meet the intelligence responsible for creating and maintaining the Earth. Use every sense. Ask: is there a message for me?
hold 30
say Still here in the core, shift your awareness to Focus 15. Notice how the core looks from this perspective.
pause 8
say Now Focus 21. Notice what changes.
pause 8
say Now Focus 27. Notice this perspective too.
pause 8
say From here, an encoding to return to this crystal any time you like: this is Earth Core 27. Inhale, and picture a six-sided crystal inside a globe. Exhale, and you'll be here again.
pause 8
say Relax here, in Earth Core 27.
pause 6
say Give thanks for what you've learned and seen.
pause 6
